<title>USA: Medtronic devices implanted in China, India.</title>
<headline>Medtronic devices implanted in China, India.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medtronic Inc said the first human implants were made of its pacemaker designed exclusively for China and other developing nations.</p>
<p>The devices were implanted Wednesday in two patients, one in China and the other in India. The company said both patients are reported to be recovering normally.</p>
<p>The Medtronic Champion pacemaker will be the initial product manufactured at the company's new wholly foreign-owned manufacturing facilty in Shanghai, China.</p>
<p>Medtronic specializes in implantable and invasive therapies.</p>
<p>	  -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
